   "day": 7,
   "text": "⚖ Salvador corners you by the stores, voice low. \"Count it with me. Right now. If I'm wrong I'll say so in front of everyone.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 9,
   "text": "⚖ Salvador waited two days for your answer. None came. \"Silence is an answer too.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 9,
   "text": "⚖ Salvador stands slowly. \"Silence had its chance. The thefts goes to the fire now — all of it, in the open, where silence doesn't count as an answer.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 12,
   "text": "⚖ Salvador corners you by the stores, voice low. \"Count it with me. Right now. If I'm wrong I'll say so in front of everyone.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 12,
   "text": "⚖ Salvador raises their voice so the whole fire hears. \"No more quiet words! The thefts get a moot — tonight, in the open, everyone.\""
